{\b\fs36 Road Diary\par}
\par
\b January 4\b0\par
The pass opened after three days of snow. Chains on, engine cold, the valley below white to the tree line.\par
\par
\b January 9\b0\par
The postman\u8217?s dog follows the sled to the bend and turns back exactly there, as if the bend were a fence only it could see.\par
